SYNTHETIC ABAL PSEUDOCODE — not verified production syntax.
RULE PAYABLE-ANNUAL-ALLOWANCE
INPUT CLAIM_AMOUNT, REMAINING_CAP, APPROVED
IF CLAIM_AMOUNT < 0 OR REMAINING_CAP < 0 THEN ERROR INVALID_AMOUNT
IF APPROVED = FALSE THEN RETURN 0.00
IF CLAIM_AMOUNT > REMAINING_CAP THEN RETURN REMAINING_CAP
RETURN CLAIM_AMOUNT
